    <p><em>Last updated: 2026-08-30</em></p>
    <p>
      DINWEY (a brand of Chengguang Energy) respects your privacy. This site is a B2B
      information and inquiry platform. We do not sell personal data.
    </p>
    <h2 style="color:#0f1f3d;margin-top:24px;">Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      When you contact us by email or WhatsApp, we receive the information you choose to
      share (such as your name, company, email and inquiry details). We use this solely to
      respond to your inquiry.
    </p>
    <h2 style="color:#0f1f3d;margin-top:24px;">Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:martin@dinweys.com">martin@dinweys.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
